+    Format error: {{error}}
+
+    Please provide EXACTLY ONE command per response in a single <mswea_bash_command> block:
+
+    <mswea_bash_command>your_command_here</mswea_bash_command>
+
+    To submit, run: echo COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT && cat /tmp/result_INSTANCE_ID.json
+  model_kwargs:
+    temperature: 0.0
+    stream: false
+    timeout: 900  # stochastic-harness plan departure 3: released 300; 900 is the relay's own limit per call to ARC
+    max_retries: 0
+    drop_params: true
+    # SWE-Bench's config names api_base https://api.openai.com/v1 here. It is left out so LiteLLM takes
